 "chapter": "14",
 "title": "热量",
 "short": "热量",
 "lead": "<span data-concept=\"heat\">热量</span>是物体之间因<span data-concept=\"temperature\">温度</span>不同而传递的<span data-concept=\"energy\">能量</span>，就像并排放着的<span data-ref=\"drink\">一罐软饮料</span>和<span data-ref=\"ice\">一块冰</span>之间那样，它与<span data-concept=\"temperature\">温度</span>不是一回事。它以焦耳、卡和千卡来计量，焦耳的<span data-ref=\"weights\">下落重物</span>和<span data-ref=\"paddles\">转动桨叶</span>表明，<span data-concept=\"work\">功</span>可以产生与<span data-concept=\"heat\">热</span>传递相同的效果。",
 "objectives": [
  "把热量定义为能量的传递。"
 ],
 "summary_html": "<ul><li><span data-concept=\"heat\">热量</span>和<span data-concept=\"work\">功</span>是<span data-concept=\"energy\">能量</span>传递的两种不同方式。</li><li><span data-concept=\"heat\">热量</span>是仅由<span data-concept=\"temperature\">温差</span>引起而传递的<span data-concept=\"energy\">能量</span>。</li><li>任何<span data-concept=\"energy\">能量</span>单位都可用于<span data-concept=\"heat\">热</span>传递，最常用的是千卡（kcal）和焦耳（J）。</li><li>千卡定义为使 1.00 kg 水的<span data-concept=\"temperature\">温度</span>在 $14.5^\\circ\\text{C}$ 与 $15.5^\\circ\\text{C}$ 之间改变所需的<span data-concept=\"energy\">能量</span>。</li><li>这种<span data-concept=\"heat\">热</span>传递的热功当量为 $1.00\\ \\text{kcal} = 4186\\ \\text{J}$。</li></ul>",
 "notes": "本书正文没有任何删减；本节没有习题集。",
